--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reverse-engineering research
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Zipee contains no code, binaries or assets from any other product. Its
competitor research under docs/research/ is Zipee's own observation and
analysis, recording only behavioural facts, symbol names and public Apple API
usage. See docs/research/README.md.
